            "sid": "NUM 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI nasungana nende Musa mumuhololookhwe kwaMoabu ahambi naYorodani eYeriko, namuboolela mbu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laka abaana baIsiraeli mbu khubulaame obuli obwabwe baheelesie abaLawi amataala akokhumenyamwo; khandi muheelesie abaLawi obwayilo obubotokhana amataala tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amataala ako kabe akabwe okhumenyamwo; nabwo obwayilo bube bwemiruko chiabwe, nemiandu chiabwe, nebiayo biabwe biosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne obwayilo bwamataala ako, obwa mulaheelesia abaLawi, burule khulukoba Iwelitaala nibutsiililila khuburambi bwamakhono eshikhumila tsimbeka tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchele elwanyi welitaala, khulwa olubeka Iwebukwe amakhono ebikhumila bibili, khulwa olubeka Iwesautsi amakhono ebikhumila bibili, khulwa olubeka lwamumbo amakhono ebikhumila bibili, khandi khulwa olubeka Iwenotsi amakhono ebikhumila bibili, litaala liene niliba hakari. Obwo bulababeela obwayilo bwamataala ako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amataala aka mulaheelesia abaLawi kabe amataala kasasaba kobwilushilo, aka mulahaana khulwa omwiri yesi okhwilushilayo; khandi mulabaheelesia amataala kandi amakhumi kane nakabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amataala ako kosi aka mulaheelesia abaLawi kalaba amataala amakhumi kane namunaane; mulakahaana halala nobwayilo bwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khumakhuwa kamataala ako aka mulahaana, okhurula khukali akabaana baIsiraeli, aha kali amanji mubukule amanji; naha kali amatuutu mubukule amatuutu; buli mundu obulaamebwe obwa alaamilwa shinga olwa buli, nolwa alaheelesia abaLawi akokhumataalake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amataala kobwilushilo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
